  "excerpt": "Artikel contoh staging: semua gaya blok tema dalam satu halaman.",
  "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-kicker\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-kicker\">Artikel contoh di staging untuk memeriksa semua gaya blok tema Nostek. Bukan untuk production.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-ribbon\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-ribbon\">Ribbon: Retro Tech, Modern Twist</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"className\": \"is-style-title-3d\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-title-3d\">Judul Retro 3D</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"className\": \"is-style-divider\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-divider\">Pembatas bagian</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Paragraf biasa dengan <strong>tebal</strong>, <em>miring</em>, <a href=\"https://staging.nostek.id/\">tautan</a> dan <code>kode</code>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Subjudul H3</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Butir satu</li><li>Butir dua dengan teks yang lebih panjang supaya baris terlipat di layar HP</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kutipan: teknologi lama, cerita baru.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Nostek</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-frame\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-frame\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kotak gaya <strong>frame</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-band\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-band\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kotak gaya <strong>band</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-info\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-info\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kotak gaya <strong>info</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-info-success\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-info-success\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kotak gaya <strong>info-success</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-info-error\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-info-error\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kotak gaya <strong>info-error</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-info-warning\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-info-warning\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kotak gaya <strong>info-warning</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-sunburst\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-sunburst\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kotak gaya <strong>sunburst</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-ruled\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-ruled\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">Tombol ruled</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-offset\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-offset\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">Tombol offset</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"className\":\"is-style-accordion\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-style-accordion\"><summary>Accordion: buka saya</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Isi accordion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Barang</th><th>Kondisi</th><th>Harga</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Walkman WM-2</td><td>B</td><td>Rp 1.250.000</td></tr><tr><td>Game Boy DMG</td><td>A</td><td>Rp 2.100.000</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>sudo bash nostek-media-1.sh PREFLIGHT --ack WEB-M1</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->",
